--[[
================================================================================
EditorScripts Installer
================================================================================
This is an auto-generated installer script. Drag it anywhere into DaVinci
Resolve's Fusion page to install the embedded script(s).

One template serves both installer flavors: a single-script installer
(SCRIPTS has one entry; classic Install/Cancel flow, always overwrites) and
the suite installer (SCRIPTS has many entries; Install / Custom Installation
flow with per-script version checks that never downgrade).

NOTE: The suite's Custom Installation view renders one checkbox row per
script. Past ~14 bundled scripts the fixed-height dialog gets unwieldy -
migrate the rows to a ui:Tree with CheckState at that point.

Generated by build.sh from src/installer/installer_template.lua - edit the
template, not the generated installer.
================================================================================
]]

